Z||000000||Jhonny||07-04-2001||04:05 AM||||Hi all,<P>Here in Sweden parts are expensive and my left side power window motor is probably shot.<BR>Does motors from other GM cars fit? If so maybe I can find one in a scrapyard.<P>Thanks,<P>Jhonny<P><P>------------------<BR>Jhonny Sokura<BR>Vadstena, Östergötland Sweden<P><A HREF="http://home.swipnet.se/jks/fiero3.jpg" TARGET=_blank> Pontiac Fiero GT -87 , V6 5spd<BR> </A>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Monkeyman||07-04-2001||06:21 AM||||I may be wrong (hey, it happens occasionally  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">), but I think the window motor is a universal GM unit.  You should have your local GM dealer do a parts interchange search.  They should be able to do that for free.  Your local boneyard should also be able to look that info up.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
